# COPY this file to `local.properties`.
# local.properties is git-ignored (root .gitignore: `android/*/local.properties`).
# NEVER commit real values from it — the keys below are real secrets.

# ── Android SDK location (machine-specific, required) ────────────────────────
# Windows example:
sdk.dir=C\:\\Users\\YOURNAME\\AppData\\Local\\Android\\Sdk
# macOS/Linux example:
# sdk.dir=/Users/yourname/Library/Android/sdk

# ── Build-time secrets (app/build.gradle::resolveSecret) ─────────────────────
# Each of these can equally be supplied as `-P<key>=<value>` on the Gradle
# command line, or as the environment variable named in brackets (the CI-secret
# path). First non-empty source wins, in that order: -P, this file, env var.
#
# aiBearerToken is NOT optional for a release-shaped build. Leaving it unset
# does not disable the AI assistant — the assistant still renders, and then
# fails with 401 from the upstream on every question. `assembleRelease` /
# `assembleStaging` therefore FAIL with instructions when it is missing;
# `assembleDebug` prints a loud warning and continues.

# aiBearerToken=...              [AURA_AI_BEARER_TOKEN]
# ownerLicensingBaseUrl=...      [AURA_OWNER_LICENSING_URL]
# ownerSyncBaseUrl=...           [AURA_SYNC_RELAY_URL]
# whatsappPhoneNumberId=...      [AURA_WHATSAPP_PHONE_NUMBER_ID]
# whatsappAccessToken=...        [AURA_WHATSAPP_ACCESS_TOKEN]
